      "post_id": "82730",
      "author_handle": "strawberry",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 2 weeks ago",
      "body": "Hi\nI am 8 wks pregnant and have had period cramping since I found out 2 weeks ago. It comes on and off and lasts for a few hours then disapears. It is quite painful sometimes and Paracetamol doesnt seem to work. I have got my first appointment with the midwife on Tuesday so I was going to talk to her then about the pain but Im not sure if I should go to the doctor beforehand.can anyone help with this?",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-8942/#82730",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/ca0620aaa744cf213631.html",
      "page_url": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-8942/",
      "role": "original_post",
      "original_post_id": "82730"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "82733",
      "author_handle": "milkymum",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 1 week ago",
      "body": "I would go the doctors before you see the midwife just to get things checked over. they might send you to the hospital for an early scan to check the positioning of baby to make sure baby is in the womb. Good luck and I hope the pain is nothing to bad",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-8942/#82733",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/ca0620aaa744cf213631.html",
