      "author_handle": "milkymum",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 13 hours ago",
      "body": "Strawberry how are things going? I never thought about braxton hickes in rare cases it is possibel to get braxton hickes this early on but is more common in multiply pregnancies or if the pregnancy is you 4ht or more pregnancy as your womb has already been strentched by other preancies sand your muscles aren't as strong as they were were with the previous pregnancies",
